                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4e1b46f-feca-4280-8c0e-09bb1556601c",
                        "source_entry_id": "4c45566a-3009-39ab-80c5-168f24452672",
                        "target_lang_word": "impressible",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "impressible",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39c13533-957f-31dd-8e88-595ee4527ce0",
                                        "entry_id": "b36d996a-217a-3294-81a6-893718973df1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of being impressed; susceptible of receiving impression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bdc65dd-6b28-44b7-95f7-84deda62ae4b",
                                                "sense_id": "39c13533-957f-31dd-8e88-595ee4527ce0",
                                                "text": "Like other men who have little religion, Mr. Paul Dangerfield had a sort of vague superstition. He was impressible by omens, though he scorned his own weakness, and sneered at, and quizzed it sometimes in the monologues of his ugly solitude."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1966e54b-1d49-3cb2-b3ff-43ca421e31df",
                                        "entry_id": "b36d996a-217a-3294-81a6-893718973df1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of being imprinted upon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0ca2f84-c047-4a78-9164-8c36da874735",
                                                "sense_id": "1966e54b-1d49-3cb2-b3ff-43ca421e31df",
                                                "text": "The differences of impressible and not impressible; figurable and not figurable; mouldable and not mouldable; scissile and not scissile; and many other passions of matter, are plebeian notions, applied unto the instruments and and uses which men ordinarily practise; but they are all but the effects of some of these causes following, which we will enumerate without applying them, because that would be too long."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "719dea7d-9d7d-3bd2-a19a-f25ca1c1b904",
                                        "entry_id": "b36d996a-217a-3294-81a6-893718973df1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of creating an impression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0de5c6ae-4e1a-45b6-9564-14e150a0f063",
                        "source_entry_id": "4c45566a-3009-39ab-80c5-168f24452672",
                        "target_lang_word": "sensitive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sensitive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c8249b1-15a5-3aa5-a7a3-2ef3a5577603",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having the faculty of sensation; pertaining to the senses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "364c3a54-5260-46b5-b2a9-21f3e251f5e6",
                                                "sense_id": "2c8249b1-15a5-3aa5-a7a3-2ef3a5577603",
                                                "text": "The sensitive faculty most part overrules reason, the soul is carried hoodwinked, and the understanding captive like a beast."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b978216-5c7f-36e0-9b37-9f4b655628f9",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Responsive to stimuli."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f6ddbd3-35ec-4411-b525-9446d94042e6",
                                                "sense_id": "1b978216-5c7f-36e0-9b37-9f4b655628f9",
                                                "text": "The engine seemed a little sensitive to wet rails, and in consequence the uphill work was not so good north of Dundee as it had been earlier. But I have noted this same \"touchiness\" on the part of the \"A4s\", and other modern British 4-6-2s, so that in this respect No. 2006 proved no exception."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0abc59f5-6be8-32cf-be90-4324d85a1e0c",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Easily offended, upset, or hurt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03fc8c89-5f1b-4a1e-b3ea-abe2506e25ad",
                                                "sense_id": "0abc59f5-6be8-32cf-be90-4324d85a1e0c",
                                                "text": "Max is very sensitive; he cried today because of the bad news."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5b4b551-2a53-30df-a9e2-cba1208b148e",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of offending, upsetting, or hurting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee9be668-a774-4b13-9457-76d3d2094df8",
                                                "sense_id": "b5b4b551-2a53-30df-a9e2-cba1208b148e",
                                                "text": "Religion is often a sensitive topic of discussion and should be avoided when dealing with foreign business associates."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a96b7349-2783-3e12-ac4c-9479bb28cf61",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Meant to be concealed or kept secret."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59393a23-30f1-4386-9e16-e543ecf84979",
                                                "sense_id": "a96b7349-2783-3e12-ac4c-9479bb28cf61",
                                                "text": "These are highly sensitive documents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f319d3aa-7184-4eba-9996-d6823daef5eb",
                                                "sense_id": "a96b7349-2783-3e12-ac4c-9479bb28cf61",
                                                "text": "Xeltan: I cannot speak more about this problem; it is too sensitive. Suffice it to say, she has compromised my authority as a diplomat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27997ebc-9469-33a0-93ef-39e78356a43d",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Being aware of the feelings of others and taking care not to offend them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "710710cf-e9b2-4c45-b7a6-a83739e9fd8c",
                                                "sense_id": "27997ebc-9469-33a0-93ef-39e78356a43d",
                                                "text": "Thank you for being sensitive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d300b49f-67be-348e-a3cd-77ea4b608d95",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Important, intricate, and requiring great delicacy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e49cfa7a-53f7-406a-ab5f-d4dfd441b06e",
                                                "sense_id": "d300b49f-67be-348e-a3cd-77ea4b608d95",
                                                "text": "The president's untimely statement disrupted some very sensitive negotiations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9c3fef46-742e-3a7e-bc39-fa7f4acb4464",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accurate; able to register small changes in some property."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of an instrument"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a04adef-c217-32fc-aab3-3ff2a3d59398",
                                        "entry_id": "cae045f1-c2b9-3cb1-868c-cbf9bf8ee72a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having paranormal abilities that can be controlled through mesmerism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sensitive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e09e5e7-0c84-3556-93f8-9ffde7b998fb",
                                        "entry_id": "c1a94ee5-7df7-30b4-aefa-acd224ed108f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with a paranormal sensitivity to something that most cannot perceive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f5a967b-c4a8-4fa4-86c3-3085f3cf09cb",
                                                "sense_id": "0e09e5e7-0c84-3556-93f8-9ffde7b998fb",
                                                "text": "[I]t is quite certain that many of their fears were unfounded, and centred upon perfectly innocent people - especially those who were what we now call \"mediumistic\" or \"sensitives\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "132f3e7a-0176-4f09-8020-3c9d7f1c0568",
                                                "sense_id": "0e09e5e7-0c84-3556-93f8-9ffde7b998fb",
                                                "text": "After all, Madame Rosita was a sensitive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca4d6db4-05aa-4048-a683-9fbd8999c347",
                                                "sense_id": "0e09e5e7-0c84-3556-93f8-9ffde7b998fb",
                                                "text": "Swedenborg was one of the leading savants of Europe; it would be absurd to place any of our sensitives on the same intellectual level."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "25f85170-22b9-4cb4-8dac-8f179a9c70e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "4c45566a-3009-39ab-80c5-168f24452672",
                        "target_lang_word": "réceptif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "réceptif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1d88804-5039-3a67-9df0-3074a0c573df",
                                        "entry_id": "1f03a65c-5416-3480-8d20-f777bce8ef73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui reçoit, qui peut recevoir des impressions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc0c2f73-0d85-481c-8b05-6184450997f3",
                                                "sense_id": "b1d88804-5039-3a67-9df0-3074a0c573df",
                                                "text": "Une plaque réceptive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "598f42d5-2aed-4045-9867-a406e4b4e64c",
                                                "sense_id": "b1d88804-5039-3a67-9df0-3074a0c573df",
                                                "text": "Un esprit réceptif."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ddba777-587f-33f2-8631-99143cf80f27",
                                        "entry_id": "1f03a65c-5416-3480-8d20-f777bce8ef73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est sensible à un agent externe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a139c6e-1d0f-4ba8-a63b-f51481d124ea",
                                                "sense_id": "4ddba777-587f-33f2-8631-99143cf80f27",
                                                "text": "L’efficacité parasitaire des adultes peut se trouver limitée par la rupture de la coïncidence spatio-temporelle entre le stade réceptif des hôtes (œufs en cours d’embryogenèse) et le stade agressif du parasitoïde (Nenon, 1974)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c0f6ba7-88d3-3a7b-851e-d3a3b0df03b0",
                                        "entry_id": "1f03a65c-5416-3480-8d20-f777bce8ef73",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui reçoit le pénis ; passif."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f900cadd-8a19-443a-8ae0-d79c0f020f33",
                                                "sense_id": "3c0f6ba7-88d3-3a7b-851e-d3a3b0df03b0",
                                                "text": "Ces catégories socio-sexuelles sont à leur tour « cadrées » par des rôles sexuels (insertif ou réceptif) respectifs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b180dd7c-1245-4528-9e19-e3c617f2cfd6",
                                                "sense_id": "3c0f6ba7-88d3-3a7b-851e-d3a3b0df03b0",
                                                "text": "Ce sont ceux qui ont les moyens financiers, donc le pouvoir, qui vont jouer dans les relations sexuelles qu’ils pourraient avoir le rôle insertif ou encore connu sous le nom de rôle actif. Ceux qui sont délaissés joueront le rôle réceptif connu également sous le nom de rôle passif, en se laissant pénétrer par la voie anale ou […] par la voie buccale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
